  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support to coordination mechanisms and policy dialogue processes in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Provision of demand-driven technical support to coordination mechanisms and policy dialogue processes in Mozambique, including support to the Development Cooperation Platform (DCP) and its Working Groups, analytical inputs and knowledge management functions, contributing to policy coordination and public administration reform processes.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
